<p class="lead">Plenty of roofs that get replaced did not need to be. If the deck is solid and the problems are wear, sun damage and a handful of leaks, an Austin roof restoration can bring the roof back to sound working condition and add years of service for a fraction of what a new roof costs. Austin Roofing will tell you honestly whether your roof is a good candidate — and if it is not, we will say so.</p>

<p>Restoration is not a quick coat of paint. It is a planned process of inspecting every component, replacing what has failed, reinforcing weak points and sealing the system against the weather, so that the roof performs like a much younger one.</p>

<h2>Restoration vs Repair vs Replacement</h2>
<p>These three options sit on a spectrum. The right one depends on how widespread the wear is and how much life the roof’s core materials still have.</p>
